  "text": "### 2. Q4 2025 Risk Dashboard & KRIs  \n**Summary:**\nCRO presented quarterly risk dashboard covering operational, credit, compliance, and technology risks.  \n**Key Findings:**  \n| KRI | Target | Q4 2025 | Trend |\n|-----|--------|---------|-------|\n| System Availability | 99.8% | 99.85% | ✅ Above |\n| Fraud Detection Rate | 97% | 97.1% | ✅ Above |\n| Reconciliation Errors | <1 per day | 0.8 per day | ✅ Below |\n| AML False Positives | <2% | 1.8% | ✅ Below |\n| Account Opening Errors | <0.5% | 0.3% | ✅ Below |  \n**Committee Observation:**\n- Strong operational performance across KRIs\n- System availability improvement from Q3 (99.8% → 99.85%)\n- Fraud detection performing well despite increased transaction volume  \n**No Exceptions Raised:** All KRIs within acceptable range.  \n---",
